                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Hobbits, men, dwarves, elves, goblins, orcs, trolls, and giants are only the most anthropomorphic of the many \"peoples\" who inhabit J.R.R. Tolkein's Middle Earth.",
            "block_bbox": [
